      "description": "The picker/packer role the worker PWA authenticates as (plan F3). Sees the task board and the worker roster read-only, executes only the tasks offered or accepted to them (`task.execute` tops out at OWN \u2014 even this role cannot execute another worker's task), sets their own presence, and confirms packages. Counts lines in whichever count session is open for their warehouse (ADR-0026) \u2014 never opens, reviews or closes one; that stays with the dispatcher (`OPERATIONS_MANAGER`). Moves stock between bins and statuses and reads stock by location, lot and roll; does not register, split or merge lots or rolls. Does not offer, reassign or override a task either.",
